Gene has been vacationing for 34 - 23 = 11 years. He goes on four vacations a year, so he has been on 11 * 4 = 44 vacations. Each vacation has its own quilt block, so he has 44 quilt blocks in total.

Final answer: \boxed{44}
#### 44

Ryan plants 2 flowers a day in his garden. After 15 days, he has planted 2 flowers/day * 15 days = 30 flowers. However, 5 of the flowers did not grow, so the total number of flowers he has is 30 flowers - 5 flowers = 25 flowers.

Final answer: \boxed{25}
